editor_description = "[필수] 지우면 오류: VisitMenu.gd _place_bubble()
Bubble tail (border + fill triangles, tip = local (0, 22)). Code puts its origin on the bubble's bottom edge over the token, or flips it (scale.y = -1) onto the top edge when the bubble sits under the token. Colours = VisitMenuBubble's SURFACE / BORDER_STRONG."
